p.src:
Varying  with respect to $\phi$ gives $\boxed{
\partial_t^2\phi-\nabla^2\phi
=
-g\delta^3(\mathbf{x})
}.$ Away from the origin this is the free wave equation. At the origin the delta function marks the particle as a localized source.

